Upstream-Name: tvhplayer
Upstream-Contact: mFat <newmfat@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/mfat/tvhplayer
Comment: The binary package also carries the built-in server, built from the
 archives pinned in packaging/tvheadend/pins.env: Tvheadend
 (https://github.com/tvheadend/tvheadend, GPL-3.0+) in /usr/libexec/tvhplayer,
 and the dtv-scan-tables data (https://github.com/tvheadend/dtv-scan-tables,
 GPL-2.0 and LGPL-2.1+) in /usr/share/tvhplayer/tvheadend. Tvheadend
 includes libhdhomerun (https://www.silicondust.com/support/linux/,
 LGPL-2.1+), linked statically for HDHomeRun tuners.

